[BDCFF]
Version=0.5

[game]
Name=Alchemyst DangerDash 7
Author=Alchemystics
Date=2026-06-18
Story=The mines of Legrath were at one point lucrative. It was first for the precious metals, until the discovery of coal further south. But ever since the advent of zelar, and the possibility that they can be transmuted into precious gems, a second mining boom at the original site had begun.\n\nUnfortunately, as it is from every other moment, these mines had become dangerous ever since they were abandoned. Unstable terrain, deadly enemies, and the high level of danger had turned away all but the most daring.\n\nYou're one of them. Grab the gems and navigate the labyrinths, at your risk...

